    "Id": "mechdef_berserker_BRZ-D4",
    "Name": "Berserker BRZ-D4",
    "Details": "Designed to engage in close-range brawls, the 100-ton Berserker debuted in 3056. A 400-rated cXL Engine paired with TSM allows the BRZ-D4 to outrun almost any other heavy- or assault-grade Mech. A Bombast Laser and 4 Clan ER Medium Lasers make up the Mech’s ranged armament while a colossal 10-ton Hatchet is lethal at close range. Angel ECM and Impact Resistant Armor keep the BRZ-D4 safe as it closes in, 4 Jump Jets provide extra mobility and allow the Berserker to execute lethal DFA attacks; while a head-mounted Flamer adds to the Mechs intimidation factor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Melee Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
    "Icon": "BerserkerP"
  },
